It probably helped that there were only a couple of major roads to modify. It began with a radio announcement from Prime Minister Malay Lemawi. The great event that would be most helpful to our livelihood and that is to die on the right-hand side of the road. And the switch was that this was perfect. That was great, but you said right hand. I think you meant left hand, right? Yeah, yeah, sorry, sorry. Yeah.
这可能有所帮助，因为只有几条主要道路需要修改。它始于总理马莱莱莫伊的广播公告。这对我们的生计最有帮助的伟大事件，那就是在道路的右侧行驶。转换是完美的。那很好，但你说了右侧。我想你是指左侧，对吧？是的，是的，抱歉，抱歉。是的。

